      "SourceElementId": "G11-U07-L04-ACTIVITY-021",
      "SourceSection": "4.3: Matching Distributions and Statistics",
      "SourceExcerpt": "The distribution of a set of data can be described by its shape. Data can be symmetric around the mean or skewed to one side or the other.",
