      "SourceSection": "4.3: Matching Distributions and Statistics",
      "SourceExcerpt": "For example, the first dot plot shows a distribution that is symmetric around the value 10. The second dot plot is skewed to the right since it is not symmetric and the tail is longer on the right side.",
